From: Petr Wozniak <petr.wozniak@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifimngr: hal bsta status
Signed-off-by: Petr Wozniak <petr.wozniak@gmail.com>

--- a/wifimngr.c
+++ b/wifimngr.c
@@ -5159,8 +5159,11 @@
 	wifi_get_ifstatus(ifname, &ifs);
 
 	ret = wifi_sta_info(ifname, &sta);
-	if (ret)
-		return UBUS_STATUS_UNKNOWN_ERROR;
+	/* Best-effort: reply even if libwifi could not fully populate the
+	 * station (e.g. mt76 STA-mode NL80211 dump returns nothing), so the
+	 * caller (map-agent, 2s ubus_invoke) never times out. print_sta_info()
+	 * only emits the connection block when bssid is set. */
+	(void)ret;
 
 	memset(&bb, 0, sizeof(bb));
 	blob_buf_init(&bb, 0);
